INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (1,'Midnight Sapphire Mini Bouquet','f1.png','Designed for those who love unique aesthetics, this arrangement brings together a striking focal tulip and matching blue accents. The intricate mesh wrap adds a touch of classic sophistication, making it a beautiful centerpiece or a thoughtful graduation present.',350.00,15,1,'Bouquet'),(2,'Triple Sunflower Bouquet','f2.png','This is a handmade fuzzy wire bouquet featuring three bright sunflowers. Because the flowers are made from fuzzy wire materials, they will not wilt and can be kept as a permanent display. The arrangement is wrapped in clean, solid white paper to make the yellow color of the flowers stand out more. It is carefully put together at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. With its neat ribbon tie, this is a very formal and simple gift suitable for graduations or thank-you presents.\r\n',650.00,15,1,'Bouquet'),(3,'Pink Lily and Rose Mix Bouquet','f3.png','This is a handmade  fuzzy wire bouquet featuring a large pink lily right in the middle. It is surrounded by  red tulips and pink roses to give it a full look. Since all the flowers and leaves are made of fuzzy wire, they will not dry out or wilt, making it a good long-lasting display piece or gift. It is wrapped securely with thick pink and clear wrappers, then tied properly with a printed ribbon at the bottom.',1100.00,15,1,'Bouquet'),(6,'Blush Serenity Bouquet','f4.png','An elegant, handcrafted fuzzy wire bouquet featuring soft pink lilies, a charming tulip, and delicate white accents. Carefully wrapped in premium frosted and pink floral paper and tied with a striking iridescent ribbon, this everlasting arrangement from Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop makes for a perfect, wilt-free gift for any special occasion.',650.00,15,1,'Bouquet'),(7,'Midnight  Fantasy Spider Lily Bouquet','1.jpeg','This is a handcrafted fuzzy wire bouquet featuring unique blue spider lilies with a single bright orange one in the center. The flowers are made from fuzzy wire so they will not wilt or fade over time. It is carefully assembled at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. The arrangement is wrapped in blue and light peach papers and tied with a double ribbon. This makes it a very formal and long-lasting display piece for any special event.\r\n',1000.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(8,'Warm Sunset Lighted Floral Basket','2.jpeg','Bring a warm and cozy feel to your space with this rustic woven basket arrangement. Handcrafted right here at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village, this display mixes a bright sunflower, orange tulips, and beautiful white lilies, all carefully shaped from fuzzy wires so they never dry out or wilt. It even features a small LED  candle nestled in the middle to give off a soft, calming glow at night. It is a great, long-lasting centerpiece for your table or a very unique gift for someone special.',850.00,15,0,'Others'),(10,'Mixed Flower Basket','3.jpeg','This product is a very colorful handmade flower basket made entirely of fuzzy wires or chenille stems. Instead of being wrapped in paper, the flowers are arranged beautifully inside a small brown woven basket with a handle and a tag that says \"FLOWER\". It contains a large mix of purple, orange, blue, magenta, and white flowers, paired with green fuzzy leaves and orange berry fillers.\r\n\r\nBecause the basket has a flat bottom, it can stand on its own. This makes it a very good display to put on top of a table, a desk, or a shelf. The materials will not wilt or dry out since they are artificial. This is a very nice product to give as a gift for Mother\'s Day or birthdays. You can buy this arrangement for your home at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop, located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village.',900.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(11,'Vintage Sunflower Bouquet','4.jpeg','This is a handmade fuzzy wire bouquet that has a very rustic and classic look because of its wrapper. It features two bright sunflowers and one large white daisy right in the middle. The flowers will not dry up or wilt because they are permanently crafted from wire materials. It is carefully assembled at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. Wrapped in vintage newspaper-print paper and tied with a gold ribbon, it is a very simple but formal gift for teachers, friends, or graduations.\r\n\r\nThe item is tied securely at the bottom with a gold satin ribbon and a thinner brown ribbon. Since it is made of wire materials, it will not fade and can be kept as a room decoration for a long time. It is a highly recommended simple gift for friends, teachers, or family members. You can purchase this product at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop, located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village.',550.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(12,'Vibrant Summer  Floral Mix','5.jpeg','This product is a large and colorful handmade flower arrangement crafted entirely from fuzzy wires or chenille stems. The centerpiece of this bouquet is a large, bright yellow sunflower. It is surrounded by a beautiful mix of flowers, including a hot pink lily, pink and yellow gerbera daisies, a dark red tulip, and small white filler flowers. It also contains artificial green eucalyptus leaves for added volume.This is a handmade fuzzy wire bouquet that mixes a large yellow sunflower with bright pink flowers. It is carefully put together at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. Because it is made of wire, the flowers are permanent and will not wilt or turn brown. It is securely wrapped in dark red and pale yellow papers with a white net inside, and then tied with a double ribbon. This is a very presentable and formal gift for graduations, birthdays, or anniversaries.\r\n',1100.00,15,0,'Others'),(15,'Pink Spring Mix','6.jpeg','This handmade fuzzy wire bouquet features a very bright and colorful mix of pink flowers that will never wilt. It is carefully arranged and put together at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. The bouquet is securely wrapped using high-quality pink and frosted papers, then finished with a large pink satin ribbon. It is a very presentable and long-lasting gift for any occasion.',750.00,15,0,'Others'),(16,'Classic White Wedding Tulip Bouquet','7.jpeg','This is a handheld bridal-style bouquet made of pure white tulips. The flowers are created using fuzzy wires, meaning they are permanent and will not wilt over time. It features faux pearl strings added between the flowers for a more elegant look. It is handcrafted at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. The stem handle is tightly bundled and wrapped with white ribbon, making it very easy to hold for weddings, anniversaries, or formal occasions.',600.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(17,'Mixed Pink Spring Bouquet','8 .jpeg','This is a very large, handmade fuzzy wire bouquet featuring a heavy mix of different pink flowers. Because it is made entirely of fuzzy wires, the blooms are permanent and will not wilt over time. This grand arrangement is crafted at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. It uses multiple shades of light pink, magenta, and peach, securely wrapped in thick pink paper with a shiny holographic backing. Tied with a large hot pink ribbon, this product is highly recommended as a premium gift for grand celebrations.',1200.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(19,'Grand Violet Wrapped Mixed Blooms','9.jpeg','This is a large, handcrafted fuzzy wire bouquet featuring a very colorful mix of pink, orange, purple, and white flowers. Since the flowers are made entirely from wire and chenille stems, they are permanent and will not wilt. It is carefully arranged and put together at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop located in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. The arrangement is securely wrapped using high-quality purple and peach floral papers, and finished with a double layer of printed and yellow ribbons. It is a highly presentable and heavy bouquet suitable for major celebrations like anniversaries or birthdays.',1500.00,15,0,'Others'),(20,'Sunny Daisy Vase','10.jpeg','This is a tabletop vase arrangement featuring bright yellow sunflowers and small white daisies. Since the flowers are handmade using fuzzy wires, they serve as a permanent display that will not dry out. It is arranged carefully at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. The flowers are placed inside a white ribbed vase decorated with a light brown ribbon and a small thank you tag. This is a very suitable item for home decorations, desk displays, or simple appreciation gifts.',800.00,14,0,'Others'),(21,'Sunrise Pink Bouquet','11.jpeg',' A handmade flower arrangement using fuzzy wires. It has a mix of pink and orange flowers, wrapped neatly in matching paper and ribbons. This is a good option for birthday gifts or special occasions.',1000.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(22,'Teacher\'s Appreciation Mini Bouquet','12.jpeg','A simple token to give to educators. It features dark and light blue wire daisies that will not wither, making it a permanent desk display.',300.00,14,0,'Bouquet'),(23,'Pink Tulip Kraft Carrier Set','13.jpeg','A small gift set inside a brown paper carrier. It comes with handmade pink tulips and a small cup that can hold treats or letters.',450.00,10,0,'Bouquet'),(24,'Crimson Night Bouquet','14.jpeg','A formal arrangement with bright red wire flowers wrapped tightly in black paper. This is a good item for anniversaries or evening events.',500.00,10,0,'Bouquet'),(25,'Light Purple Daisy Bouquet','15.jpeg','A formal arrangement of handmade wire daisies. It uses layered pink wrappers and a sparkly white mesh at the bottom.',950.00,0,0,'Bouquet'),(26,'The Joyful Abundance Bouquet','16.jpeg','Our most vibrant and eclectic arrangement. This large bouquet features a stunning fuchsia center lily surrounded by a festive mix of peach tulips, yellow daffodils, and whimsical coiled greenery. A truly show-stopping handmade gift that never fades.',850.00,0,0,'Bouquet'),(27,'Classic Blue Craft Bouquet','17.jpeg','This item has a mix of main flowers and small white fillers. It is wrapped carefully with a white inner mesh and matte blue papers to make it look full and presentable.',650.00,0,0,'Bouquet'),(28,'Single Sunflower Box Bundle','19.jpeg','This item features a mini bouquet with one permanent sunflower wrapped in white paper. It is securely arranged inside a box with a clear lid alongside a stuffed toy.',350.00,10,0,'Bouquet'),(29,'One Piece Craft Tulip','20.jpeg','We are selling this wire tulip per piece. It is a good and budget-friendly present for your friends in Las Piñas, BF Resort Village. It will not wilt because it is made of craft wires.',70.00,15,0,'Bouquet'),(30,'Mixed Flower and Chocolate Bundle','21.jpeg',' The bouquet contains pink tulips, a large lily, and assorted chocolate bars attached to sticks. It looks very full and heavy, making it a proper present for anniversaries or birthdays.',1500.00,0,0,'Bouquet'),(31,'Raffle TIcket','22.jpeg','Good day! Are you looking for customized raffle tickets for your upcoming events, business promotions, or fundraising?\r\n\r\nI am offering affordable Raffle Ticket Layout and Printing services. You can fully send me your own design, colors, and all the details that you want to put in your tickets.\r\n\r\nHere are my available services and rates:\r\n\r\nBulk Bundle of 10 Pads (1,000pcs) for only ₱ 1,100 \r\n\r\nWhat I will need from you to send me in Message or Chat:\r\n\r\nYour Event or Business Name\r\n\r\nThe Ticket Price, List of Prizes, and Draw Date\r\n\r\nYour Logo (if you have one) and preferred colors',1100.00,28,0,'Others'),(32,'Personalized Lebel Sticker','23.jpeg','Good Day! Everyone I am offering customized name label stickers, and you can now order even just a single sheet. If you only need a few sticker for your personalized items, water bottle, or school notebook, this for you.\r\n\r\nhow the process?\r\n\r\njust send me your favorite them or style, cartoon character and also you send me the detail that i put here in your personalized label sticker\r\nyou send this using message/chat\r\n\r\nmatte or waterproof vinyl ₱180\r\n\r\n\r\n',180.00,10,0,'Others'),(33,'Christmas Card','24.jpeg','Good day everyone. Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop is now offering Custom Card Sets. This is a very unique and useful souvenir for Christmas parties, birthdays, weddings, or corporate giveaways.\r\n\r\nWe can customize cards. You can request to put your own pictures, business logo, event theme, or a special message.\r\n\r\nHow the process? \r\n\r\nJust chat me in message / chat  for details',200.00,0,0,'Others'),(34,'M,enu Card','25.jpeg','Good day. Make your event table setup extra special with our Custom Die-Cut Menu Cards at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop. This is perfect for weddings, bridal showers, debuts, and intimate parties.\r\n\r\nHow the Process?\r\n\r\njust chat me or message and then send me the details of you want to put here',100.00,0,0,'Others'),(35,'Invitation Card','26.jpeg','Good Day! Everyone we personalized a invitation card that can use for Part, Birthday, Event and also in wedding\r\n\r\nHow the process?\r\n\r\njust chat me or message \r\n\r\njust send me the details or what u want to put here in invitation card\r\n\r\n100 sets of invitation card with envelop',1200.00,0,0,'Others'),(36,'Personalized Wooden Wedding Ring','27.jpeg','Good day to our soon-to-be brides and grooms! Ditch the traditional ring pillow and elevate your wedding ceremony with our Customized Wooden Ring Bearer Tray here at Gazette in Vines Flower and Craft Shop.\r\n\r\nThis elegant, rustic keepsake features a beautiful arrangement of premium dried flowers, a stunning gold-framed geometric glass ring box, and a personalized wooden base featuring your names and wedding date. It also doubles as a beautiful home decor piece after your big day!\r\n\r\n\r\nHow the Process?\r\njust chat me or message\r\n\r\nthis is are per pieces\r\n1800 per pieces',1800.00,0,0,'Others'),(37,'Personalized Label Glass','28.jpeg','Good Day! Everyone this is the personalized lable glass that use for souvenir, event, birthday, binyag or gift.\r\n\r\nthe process of this is chat/message to me the\r\n\r\nname or label that i put in her glass or image \r\n\r\nset 24 glass with custom labels  ₱1200 ',1200.00,0,0,'Others'),(38,'Personalized Sunglasses With Label','29.jpeg','This is the sunglasses that have a label you can personalized your own if you want just \r\n\r\nchat or message me for details \r\n\r\n50 pieces set for only 3500  \r\n',3500.00,0,0,'Others'),(39,'Personalized Straw Bag','30.jpeg','personalized straw bag is the best gift for event like wedding, party event and birthday event.\r\n for more details just chat me /message\r\n \r\n10pcs of this 4500',4500.00,0,0,'Others'),(40,'Personalized Ballpen','31.jpeg','This is the best gift for occasions it like souvenir with label you can put the name of person u want to gift this especially with event like birthday party, wedding event \r\n\r\njust chat me or message for details \r\n\r\n100pcs for 3500',3500.00,0,0,'Others'),(41,'Personalized Tumbler with Label','32.jpeg','This called the tumbler that u can customized your own label this can be gift as a souvenir\r\n\r\nfor more details just chat or message me\r\n\r\n100pcs  for only 3000',3000.00,0,0,'Others'),(42,'Personalized Tumbler with Label','33.jpeg','This tumbler have a label that u can personalized base of you want to input details this usually gift as a souvenir for event\r\n  \r\nfor more details just chat or message me\r\n\r\n100pcs for 3000',3000.00,0,0,'Others'),(43,'Personalized Loot Box','34.jpeg','This is the loot box that usually use for children party or wedding event or birthday party this like a souvenir that everyone of something